&HEAD CHID='bndf_domain', TITLE='Boundary data on the walls of the domain for fdsreader (#81)' /
&MESH ID='West', IJK=10,10,10, XB=0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /
&MESH ID='East', IJK=5,5,5, XB=1.0,2.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /
&TIME T_END=2.0 /
&DUMP NFRAMES=4, SMOKE3D=F /
&REAC FUEL='PROPANE' /
&SURF ID='FIRE', HRRPUA=500.0 /
The vent splits the floor of both meshes into several patches
&VENT XB=0.6,1.6,0.3,0.7,0.0,0.0, SURF_ID='FIRE' /
&VENT DB='XMIN', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT DB='ZMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
An obstruction standing on the floor
&OBST ID='Box', XB=0.2,0.4,0.6,0.8,0.0,0.2 /
&BNDF QUANTITY='BURNING RATE', CELL_CENTERED=T /
&BNDF QUANTITY='WALL TEMPERATURE' /
&TAIL /
